        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: RCO Holdings Ltd, ISS A/S\n- People: Jeff Gravenhorst\n- Industries: Cleaning, catering, security, porterage, facility management, support services, property services, facility outsourcing\n- Roles: Group CEO\n\nFacts:\n- RCO Holdings Ltd was in the cleaning, catering, security, and porterage business.\n- ISS A/S provides cleaning services, support services, property services, catering services, security services, and facility management services.\n- Jeff Gravenhorst is the Group CEO of ISS A/S.\n- ISS A/S is a Denmark-based global facility outsourcing company.\n- ISS A/S has more than 510,000 employees.\n- ISS A/S is the world’s fourth largest private employer.",
